<p style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text);">- 12.5mm plasterboard (most common) — to BS EN 520, Type A (standard), Type H (moisture-resistant), Type F (fire), Type D (impact), Type I (sound)
